---
// The gallery's two hints: how to install a theme on the
// device, and where to go to make and share your own.
---

<div class="tg-hints">
  <p class="tg-hint">
    <span class="tg-hint__label">How to install</span>
    On your device, press <strong>Menu</strong>, open <strong>Actions</strong>, choose
    <strong>Pak Rat</strong> and press <strong>Y</strong> for themes.
    <a href="/guide/pak-rat-themes/">Installing themes from Pak Rat</a>
  </p>
  <p class="tg-hint">
    <span class="tg-hint__label">Make your own</span>
    Design a theme, then share it with everyone.
    <a href="/guide/submit-a-theme/">Submit a theme</a>
  </p>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .tg-hints {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }
  .tg-hint {
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--tg-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    background: var(--sl-color-bg);
  }
  .tg-hint__label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    color: var(--tg-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tg-hint a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.2rem; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
